WEBVTT

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:05.070
<i>That news again: thanks to the 
swift response of the Ursus Guards,</i>

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:08.780
<i>the riots in Chernobog are 
gradually being contained.</i>

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.830
<i>The rioting has largely been 
quelled in most districts,</i>

00:00:11.830 --> 00:00:14.600
<i>and public order is being restored.</i>

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.990
<i>All citizens are advised to stay indoors 
until the Ursus Guards have prevailed.</i>

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:23.730
<i>That news again: thanks to the 
swift response of the Ursus Guards,</i>

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:27.340
<i>the riots in Chernobog are 
gradually being contained.</i>

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:30.000
<i>All citizens are advised to stay indoors...</i>

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.340
Captain! There's too many 
of them! If this keeps up—

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:35.130
Filthy Infected!

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.680
Dammit! Where's our backup—

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:39.900
Calm down!

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.160
They're just a bunch of hapless scumbags!

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:44.240
In the name of the Emperor, we have to defend...

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:45.780
Hey, where are you going?!

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.690
Running in the face of the enemy is—

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:00.830
I got away!

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:08.750
Let's go.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.010
Take the one in the black hood alive.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:13.250
Kill the rest.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:52.170
<i>Thanks to the swift response of the Ursus 
Guards, the riots in Chernobog will soon end.</i>

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:56.660
<i>The riots have been put down in almost
all districts, and the situation is now stable.</i>

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.170
<i>That news again...</i>

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:04.660
<i>Thanks to the swift response of the Ursus 
Guards, the riots in Chernobog will soon...</i>

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:06.580
You've got to hand it to them, 
coming up with that fake news.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:10.790
Hard to believe the Ursus Guards 
would get pushed into a corner, though.

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:15.290
Seems the government isn't really 
serious about suppressing the riots.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:19.150
I can't imagine Reunion's capable of
 pulling strings behind the scenes...

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:23.470
Right, but it's not entirely out of 
the question, given the situation.

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:25.300
Amiya.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.990
We can't afford to help anyone right now.

00:03:28.990 --> 00:03:34.000
I know how you feel, but our priority is 
getting the Doctor back to Rhodes Island.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:35.330
I get it...

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.400
I know what you're saying.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.900
You've done very well, Amiya.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.150
Ace.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:46.890
All that's left is to regroup with 
Nearl and Scout, and evacuate.

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:47.990
Right.

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.130
Doctor?

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:53.250
What's wrong?

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:54.750
This mist...

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:56.920
It's strange.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:58.500
You're right.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.980
It's getting thicker.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.720
Enemy Arts?

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:05.010
Form a circle.

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:05.810
Roger.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.220
All combatants, form up
 around the stretcher.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.810
Hurry. While visibility is still good.

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:13.600
<i>No hostile target in sight.</i>

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.100
<i>Status updated.</i>

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:16.980
<i>Enemy drone in sight.</i>

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.570
<i>All friendly scout 
drones have been hit</i>

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.700
<i>and expired.</i>

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:26.120
All units, under the trees! Quick!

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:33.330
They probably fired to intimidate us.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:37.330
So their goal was to get us to split up?

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.090
The mist's so thick now.

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.260
We can't tell where anyone is...

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:45.000
Stop! Let go!

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:45.630
Stop it!

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:51.520
Amiya.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:52.520
Dobermann!

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:55.490
Ace and his team are 
fighting on the other side.

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:58.520
No idea how many there are, 
but it doesn't seem like a lot.

00:04:59.170 --> 00:05:01.360
I'll fire a flare to request backup.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:04.530
We need to find out who's manipulating
 this mist to improve visibility.

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:08.390
We'll work with our backup to take down
the enemy, and get out of here.

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:09.030
Right.

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:10.830
What's wrong?

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:12.520
The Doctor's gone.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:13.620
What?

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:14.980
Weren't you together?

00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:22.170
Don't move.

00:05:23.230 --> 00:05:24.760
One wrong move and I'll kill you.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.480
I'm looking for someone.

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.760
Tell me everything you know.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.430
I don't know...

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:34.590
I don't know anything...

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.450
Don't tell me you forgot.

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.400
What a bother.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:45.280
I thought I was meant 
to be in charge of this area.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:48.500
You have to tell me if you want to hunt here,

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.280
Crownslayer.

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.560
I'm a nice guy, though.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:57.350
If you leave right now, 
I'll pretend I didn't see anything.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.550
The enemy's retreating?

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:06.840
The mist is clearing up, too.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:11.050
Doctor!

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:14.520
Now, would you kindly leave?

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:18.790
You still have some work to do, don't you?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.210
Step away from the Doctor!

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:23.350
Hmph...

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:26.980
I look forward to seeing you fail miserably.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.270
Big talk.

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:34.710
Looks like the enemy commanders 
don't work well with each other.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:38.540
Hello there. I know Crownslayer's rude,
 but forgive her, won't you?

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:42.380
It doesn't look like he's going to attack us.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.420
We can't be sure. Stay on your guard.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:46.560
Your commander is fine.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:48.450
Sorry for the commotion.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.430
Okay, go ahead.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:50.770
Doctor!

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:52.720
Hey, you okay?

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:53.140
Yes.

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:55.030
Doctor, are you all right?

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.910
Is that kid the one behind the mist?

00:06:56.910 --> 00:07:00.140
No, I think he released the Doctor 
from the one manipulating the mist.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.600
There's no telling what he's thinking.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:06.980
Listen. Luckily, everyone's alive,

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:10.490
but some of us are wounded. 
Pretty badly, too.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:15.000
Right. Once we make it through this bit, 
there's a spot where we can patch them up.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.210
Doctor, good to have you back.

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.500
Now, let's get going.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:21.500
Great! Looks like everyone's here.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.790
Sorry for not introducing myself.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:25.970
My name's Mephisto.

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:29.510
Now, let's play a fun little game together!

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:32.750
I knew he wasn't going
 to let us go that easily.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:35.020
I'll buy us time. Move.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:39.020
We don't have time to play with kids!

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:44.690
Oh? And here I was, giving you 
such a sincere invitation.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.390
But you'd rather run?

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:47.140
Hold!

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:47.940
It's an ambush.

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:51.450
Relax. I'm not going to do anything yet.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:54.450
You see, I'm pretty interested in you.

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.160
I read your files.

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:03.440
You're a pharma company, but you do 
more than just play with test tubes.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:08.170
You fight shoddily to avoid taking lives, 
and you've got a big crowd going along with that.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.770
My interest is piqued.

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:14.200
Especially about you, my friend who 
got pulled out of the sarcophagus.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.180
Yes, you! The one with the face 
hidden under that black hood!

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:21.440
You look kind of different 
from the rest of us.

00:08:21.440 --> 00:08:24.040
Who are you? Where are you from?

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:27.600
How did you survive?

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:30.190
Ah, I'm so <i>curious</i>!

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:32.530
I changed my mind.

00:08:33.170 --> 00:08:35.920
How about you hand that one over to me?

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:37.780
That way—

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:37.780
That's not going to happen!

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:40.300
What a shame.

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:44.420
If you'd cooperated, 
I could've let the rest of you go...

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.330
Okay, let's play a game.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.190
Here are the rules.

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:51.700
My friends here will try 
to tear you to shreds.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:55.810
If you take all of them down and 
even one of you survives, you win!

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:59.290
How about it? A simple yet thrilling game, no?

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:02.100
There's a Catastrophe coming! 
Why are you doing this?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:04.030
What are you talking about?

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:09.110
It's the Catastrophe that makes 
this the best time to party!

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:11.610
You sick bastard. What are you after?

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:13.530
What am I after?

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.610
I'm not "after" anything.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:18.870
You have nothing to do with our goals,

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:23.240
so you dying or not doesn't 
actually make a difference.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:24.620
He's insane...

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:28.630
Now, enough with the chit-chat.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:33.300
My hooded friend, let me have some fun.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:36.300
Do it.

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:43.380
Run!

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:49.350
You're no different from 
that coward, Crownslayer.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:52.300
That's not going to buy you any time.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:55.580
Caster, target C-5.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.080
You all right?!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:00.620
Next, B-6.

00:10:01.360 --> 00:10:02.180
Dammit!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.240
Got you now!

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:08.460
Now, let me watch how you suffer...

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:09.580
Hm?

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:13.090
Oh? A few of you are missing.

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:20.190
You're taking the wounded with you? 
What a humane and incompetent commander.

00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:24.350
That's exactly what I like, though. 
It makes you worth tormenting to death.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.350
Get them.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.770
Target G-3.

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:32.520
Hold on a little longer... 
We're almost there.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:40.490
Amiya!

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:44.360
Not terribly impressive.

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:47.500
Now, like sparks on a rainy night...

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.370
Die.

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:52.810
What?!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:55.670
Backup?

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:57.550
You've got to be kidding!

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:58.920
Finally...

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:01.430
Sorry I'm late.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.510
No, don't be sorry.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.970
You must be the Doctor.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.980
I am Nearl, the Radiant Knight of Kazimierz.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:11.980
I'm here to bring you home.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:20.580
You ruined it...

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:24.410
You ruined... my game!

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.910
Your men are too sloppy.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:34.920
The Reunion fighters who captured the 
city's strongholds were much more effective.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:39.670
You're just letting your rioters run 
rampant and kill innocent civilians

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:43.800
to satisfy your base desires, nothing more.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.270
Surrender!

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.720
Faust!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.810
I want her shot through the mouth!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.730
What? She blocked it?!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.110
Sniper!

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:58.630
Smoke out!

00:11:58.630 --> 00:11:59.970
Impossible!

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:01.360
Try again!

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:02.780
Blow her to pieces!

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:06.120
Crossfire cannon?

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:09.120
Why?

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:12.040
Nearl, the wounded have been evacuated!

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.170
Roger. All units, pull out!

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:15.250
Why?

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:19.250
Why don't you just roll over and die?

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:22.060
How can they still stand after that?

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:22.970
Hurry!

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.950
<i>Amiya, we're done here. Get out now.</i>

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:26.730
Right!

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:31.770
K-Kill... Kill...

00:12:33.860 --> 00:12:35.110
Thanks!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:35.880
Let's go.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:36.610
Right!

00:12:38.710 --> 00:12:40.280
<i>It's just you there now, Nearl!</i>

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:45.410
Nearl!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.260
This way!

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:50.790
Let's go!

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:00.550
What a boring game.

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:03.550
Mephisto, I'm sorry.

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.550
I screwed up.

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.960
It's all right. Don't apologize.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.740
It was all their fault.

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:15.560
Talulah should have Chernobog's 
command tower under her control by now.

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:18.450
I'll go pay her a visit.

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:21.310
Can I ask you to track Rhodes Island for me?

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:22.570
All right.

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:27.570
We'll let her decide the 
fate of these insects.

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:30.080
Faust.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:32.080
Be careful.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:35.750
The men are yours to waste as you need.

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:39.290
Your safety comes before 
everything else. Okay?

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:41.090
Yeah.

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:44.090
Right then, let's go, friends!

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:48.600
Let us go forth into our new era.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:57.100
We'll leave as soon as the 
wounded are patched up.

00:13:57.430 --> 00:14:01.860
We're almost out of the city. 
Just bear with it a little longer.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:04.820
They really trashed this place.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.450
I never imagined things 
would turn out like this...

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:10.450
Amiya, isn't this place...

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:13.870
Yes, it's the Azazel Clinic.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:20.710
Doctor, in this country, 
if you're found to have Oripathy,

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:24.870
you're taken straight to a quarantine zone.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:30.110
That's why a lot of people here hide their 
infections and carry on with their lives.

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:35.720
This is where they receive 
treatment in secret.

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:38.880
In other words, a back-alley clinic.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:43.160
Seems they might've had 
dealings with Reunion, too...

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:51.740
From the look of it, they probably refused 
some demand and paid the price for it.

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:56.290
Didn't they turn us down, too?

00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:58.910
Really gave us the cold shoulder.

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:04.340
They probably did the same to Reunion.

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:08.050
If you ask me, they had it coming!

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:09.560
Calm down.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:11.340
That's the way it had to be.

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:13.430
You get it, don't you?

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.470
It's hard for them to trust anyone.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:22.100
I think... things must've 
been difficult for them.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:27.110
Even if you're both Infected, that doesn't 
mean it's easy to trust each other.

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:32.610
If you don't build a wall to protect yourself,
 you'll find yourself in harm's way.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.180
That's probably what they had in mind.

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:38.190
We can't blame them for thinking that way.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:43.440
We wanted a place where the 
Infected would not be ostracized.

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:47.580
Where they could live as human beings. 
That's why we built Rhodes Island.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:52.230
There are a lot of people who 
still haven't opened their hearts,

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:59.390
but most of us Rhodes Islanders are 
working to overcome this barrier together.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:03.080
Just like Rhodes Island,

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:07.400
this clinic was probably built to 
give the Infected some comfort.

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:12.270
You're right. They're trying 
their hardest to survive, too.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:15.410
I'm sorry. I didn't think it through.

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.080
Don't worry about—

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.600
Ow!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:19.960
Are you okay?

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:20.820
What happened?

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:25.500
I'm sorry. I think I might've gotten 
hurt in that battle just now.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.460
Hey, we need a free medic operator over here!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.920
I-I'll go myself!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.020
Let me take your jacket.

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:35.510
Thank you.

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:40.140
Our leader needs to take 
better care of herself.

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:42.910
Right. I will.

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:45.150
Lift your right arm a little, please.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.400
Thankfully, you're not bleeding.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.820
I'll use Arts to control the inflammation.

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:53.770
Doctor?

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:55.580
Oh, right.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:16:58.320
Let me explain the principles behind Arts.

00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:03.570
There's a mineral inside 
this tool called Originium.

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:06.330
It's the source of our Arts' energy.

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:12.370
It's only with this conduit that those 
with a natural aptitude can use Arts.

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:14.970
The effects depend on the user.

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:20.970
There are those who can heal, like this guy, 
and those who can burn a whole town to cinders.

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:26.980
Our civilization exists only because of the 
industrial applications of these abilities.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:32.480
It's thanks to Originium that 
we're blessed with the lives we live.

00:17:32.960 --> 00:17:38.080
But Originium is also
 the source of Oripathy.

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:38.990
Your wrist...

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:42.990
Right. This is Originium, too.

00:17:43.480 --> 00:17:47.220
If you use the Originium inside 
your body as your conduit,

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.000
you don't need any tools to use Arts.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.920
Oripathy can even enhance your Arts.

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:57.550
It's a double-edged sword. 
It's essentially using your life force as fuel.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.550
It hastens the user's death.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:04.410
It's the price you pay for that blessing.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:08.070
If only there was a cure for Oripathy, 
things wouldn't be so tough.

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:14.320
To be exact, this clinic didn't try to heal. 
It tried to slow the progression of symptoms.

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:18.150
That's all we can do with 
our technology right now.

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:20.250
And we're done. How do you feel?

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:23.330
I feel much better. Thank you.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.720
That's right...

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:29.210
If only we could cure Oripathy like this...

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:34.210
That's why we need to bring you back 
to Rhodes Island at all costs, Doctor.

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:36.710
I'm sorry...

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:38.000
Oh!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:40.950
No, I'm sorry.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:43.220
I didn't mean to put pressure on you.

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:47.230
We've finished treating the 
wounded. Let's get moving.

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:50.850
Doesn't look like we can reach Scout's team.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:51.990
I see...

00:18:51.990 --> 00:18:54.230
Anyway, let's hurry to the rendezvous point.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:55.570
Doctor.

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:00.740
I have a friend who's lost her memories, too.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:07.240
This is just my opinion, but what's important 
isn't your past or the memories you've lost.

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:11.620
It's your "present" and your "future."

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.220
Thanks.

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:30.110
Scout's team isn't here yet, huh?

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:34.640
It's too quiet.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:37.070
Doctor, could it be a trap?

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:38.900
No... It's just...

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:40.150
What is it?

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.910
<i>Warning: Rear side heat source detected.</i>

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.450
Is it... a fire?

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:48.980
It's true that there's a fire 
spreading in that area...

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.710
Could it be...

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:53.200
We'll scope out the square.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:55.300
If anything happens, you're our backup.

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:56.460
Understood.

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:00.120
We'll stand by here and watch our six.

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:02.520
Ace?

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.970
Did something happen here?

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:07.430
Well...

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:08.470
No, it's nothing.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:13.030
It was a long time ago. One day, 
if I feel like it, I'll tell you about it.

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:13.930
All right.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.560
Let's hurry to the square.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:17.770
What's wrong?

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:19.280
Right now.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:21.530
<i>Warning: Heat source detected.</i>

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:25.030
Evacuate! Move!

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:39.750
Th-These Arts...

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:42.050
They're worse than the data said!

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:44.260
The tyrant of Reunion...

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:46.300
Talulah!

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:48.780
Secure an evac route!

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:51.140
Doctor, please take command of—

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:24.910
You should have joined us for real.

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:28.770
What have the Infected done?

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:33.640
What have the innocent done?

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:38.690
What can you do?

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:45.100
What can idealists do 
with their empty promises?

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:48.530
This is as far as you go.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.240
Your ideals won't spread.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:57.710
Your naive dreams won't come true.

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:03.710
But I'll tell you how I want things to end.

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:06.970
Annihilation.
